# FluxReviews — Netlify Redirects
#
# /movie/* SPA routing — serves index.html for all movie slug URLs
# so /movie/hrudhayam-murali works without a 404.
# The sitemap redirect lives in netlify.toml (not here) so it can
# use the serverless function syntax that _redirects doesn't support.
/movie/*  /index.html  200
